  "details": "It’s been four days now and it doesn’t matter if I use a Quest 2 headset or a laptop, when I open the app and it logs me in, it says it is loading my home world, but then it for less than a second it brings me to a glitched under- the-map version of the last world I was in before disconnecting. Then it kicks me back to the log in and repeats the process over and over in an endless loop.\n\nWhen it started I was in an avatar world for a few minutes the last time I was successfully logged in 4 days ago, then tried to join a pastel planet hangout world with a friend when the app crashed (This originally happened on my Meta Quest 2 headset). Today (9/23/2024), I tried to log into my account on a laptop, and the glitch is still happening.\n\nThis issue hasn’t stopped since, both on my headset and on laptop. I have tried uninstalling and reinstalling the app and then trying again, but nothing works.",
